3. Wrapped the component in a Suspense boundary to handle any lazy loading

4. Added proper error handling and fallback UI

These changes should resolve the import error and provide the necessary context for the component to render properly. The providers match those shown in the error stack trace, ensuring that the component has access to all the required context and services.

